{
  "id": "RAW_3a31aad383",
  "title": "第三种价格：我测量了 393 个 LLM 的提示缓存，发现一个 JSON 字段背后隐藏着 90% 的折扣",
  "url": "https://dev.to/ptokito/the-third-price-i-measured-prompt-caching-across-393-llms-and-found-a-90-discount-hiding-behind-eck",
  "date": "2026-08-26 01:23:20",
  "author": "ptokito",
  "siteName": "DEV Community: machinelearning",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>Same model. Same prompt. Ten minutes apart.\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>$0.00464 per request\n$0.00069 per request\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>The difference was one JSON field.</p>\n  <p>I spent last week measuring what LLM requests actually cost, expecting to write about tokenizer differences. I found something more useful instead.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"every-cost-comparison-uses-two-numbers\" href=\"#every-cost-comparison-uses-two-numbers\"> </a> Every cost comparison uses two numbers</h2>\n  <p>Open any LLM pricing page. You get price per input token and price per output token. Every comparison article, every spreadsheet, every \"which model is cheapest\" post uses those two numbers.</p>\n  <p>Providers publish a third one:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>prompt              $0.000002    fresh input\ninput_cache_read    $0.0000002   cached input      &lt;- 10x cheaper\ninput_cache_write   $0.0000025   writing to cache  &lt;- 25% MORE\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>For RAG and agent workloads, that third line is where most of your money lives. Here's why. A typical RAG support prompt breaks down like this (measured, not estimated):\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>system prompt          96 tokens   32%   identical on every request\nretrieved context     143 tokens   48%   often stable across a session\nconversation history   55 tokens   18%   prefix is stable\nuser message            6 tokens    2%   the only genuinely new part\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p><strong>98% of that prompt is repeated content being billed at full price.</strong></p>\n  <h2><a name=\"what-i-measured\" href=\"#what-i-measured\"> </a> What I measured</h2>\n  <p>I sent a 2,600-token system prompt to Claude Sonnet twice, ten minutes apart, through an API gateway so both providers ran through identical client code. Then the same test against GPT-4o-mini. Then I pulled pricing for every model on the platform.</p>\n  <p>Three separate findings came out of it.</p>\n  <h3><a name=\"finding-1-anthropic-caches-only-if-you-ask\" href=\"#finding-1-anthropic-caches-only-if-you-ask\"> </a> Finding 1: Anthropic caches only if you ask</h3>\n  <p>First run, no cache configuration at all:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>cold:  input=2253  cached=0  cost=$0.00470600\nwarm:  input=2251  cached=0  cost=$0.00464200\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Nothing cached. Full price both times. No error, no warning, no hint that a 90% discount was available.</p>\n  <p>Then the identical prompt with a <code>cache_control</code> marker on the system message:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight python\"><code><span class=\"n\">body</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">model</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">~anthropic/claude-sonnet-latest</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">max_tokens</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">messages</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">system</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[{</span>\n                <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">type</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">text</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">text</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">PREFIX</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">cache_control</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">type</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">ephemeral</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>   <span class=\"c1\"># &lt;- this line\n</span>            <span class=\"p\">}]</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">},</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">user</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">question</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">],</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Result:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>cold:  input=2628  cached=0     written=2614  cost=$0.00676300\nwarm:  input=2626  cached=2614  written=0     cost=$0.00068680\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p><strong>90% cheaper on every request after the first.</strong></p>\n  <p>Note the first request cost <em>more</em> than the uncached version: $0.00676 vs $0.00464, about 46% more. That's the cache write premium. You're ahead by request two, but if you send a prompt exactly once, caching loses you money.</p>\n  <h3><a name=\"finding-2-openai-does-it-for-free\" href=\"#finding-2-openai-does-it-for-free\"> </a> Finding 2: OpenAI does it for free</h3>\n  <p>Same test, GPT-4o-mini, no configuration whatsoever:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>cold:  input=1355  cached=0      cost=$0.00021525   1737ms\nwarm:  input=1355  cached=1280   cost=$0.00011145   1223ms\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>1,280 of 1,355 input tokens served from cache. <strong>48% cheaper and 30% faster</strong>, with no code change at all.</p>\n  <p>So the discount exists on both providers. On one it's automatic. On the other you have to know to ask, and nothing tells you that you're paying full price.</p>\n  <p>If your team assumed caching was automatic everywhere, your Anthropic traffic has been costing up to 10x more than necessary and no signal in the response would have told you.</p>\n  <h3><a name=\"finding-3-one-character-destroys-everything\" href=\"#finding-3-one-character-destroys-everything\"> </a> Finding 3: one character destroys everything</h3>\n  <p>I changed a single character at the front of the prompt:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>warm (identical prefix):     cached=1280\nbroken (1 char changed):     cached=0\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Every token after that character had to be reprocessed at full price.</p>\n  <p>This is documented behavior, but seeing it is different from reading it. Caching matches on the <em>prefix</em>, exactly. Anthropic's docs describe it as covering tools, then system, then messages in that order, up to the cache breakpoint. Azure's guidance puts the practical rule bluntly: stable content at the beginning, dynamic content at the end.</p>\n  <p>Which means this is a structural property of how you build prompts, not a config flag:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight python\"><code><span class=\"c1\"># CACHES WELL\n</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">system</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>     <span class=\"c1\"># stable\n</span>    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">system</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">RETRIEVED_CONTEXT</span><span class=\"p\">},</span> <span class=\"c1\"># stable per session\n</span>    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">user</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">user_question</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>       <span class=\"c1\"># changes\n</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># CACHES NOTHING\n</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">system</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">Time: </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"nf\">now</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">SYSTEM_PROMPT</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># timestamp\n</span>    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">user</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">user_question</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>                        <span class=\"c1\"># kills prefix\n</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>A timestamp at the top of your system prompt invalidates the cache on every single request. So does a user ID, a session ID, or anything else that varies.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"across-the-whole-catalog\" href=\"#across-the-whole-catalog\"> </a> Across the whole catalog</h2>\n  <p>I pulled pricing for all 393 models available on the platform:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight plaintext\"><code>models priced:        393\nwith cache pricing:   248  (63%)\nwithout:              145\ndiscount   min 1.0x   median 10.0x   max 120.8x\nwrite premium charged by 50 of 71 models publishing one\n\ndistribution:\n  under 5x     68  ##########\n  5-9x         53  ########\n  ~10x        120  ###################\n  11-25x        1\n  over 25x      6\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Three things worth pulling out:</p>\n  <p><strong>About a third of models don't support caching at all.</strong> That makes cache support a model <em>selection</em> criterion, not just a configuration step.</p>\n  <p><strong>The median discount is exactly 10x</strong>, but the range runs from 1.0x to 120x. The 1.0x entries (a published cache price identical to fresh input) turned out to be small open-weight models like Granite 8B and <code>gpt-oss-20b</code>, where input is already nearly free. Not traps, just models where caching is economically pointless.</p>\n  <p><strong>70% of models publishing a write price charge a premium for it.</strong> This appears to be recent: OpenAI models before the GPT-5.6 family charged nothing for cache writes, and newer ones can.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"three-things-that-will-bite-you\" href=\"#three-things-that-will-bite-you\"> </a> Three things that will bite you</h2>\n  <p><strong>Minimum prefix length.</strong> OpenAI skips caching below 1,024 tokens (2,048 on older models). Below the bar you pay full price and get no error. <code>cached_tokens</code> just returns 0. My original test prompt was 317 tokens and would have gotten nothing. I added a guard to my script specifically because I nearly published savings numbers for a prompt that could never have been cached.</p>\n  <p><strong>Short TTL.</strong> Cache entries expire after roughly five minutes of inactivity (Anthropic offers a paid one-hour window). There is a subtle trap here. Anthropic measures the lifetime from the <em>start</em> of the request, and generation time counts against it. A response that streams for four minutes leaves about one minute for the follow-up to land a hit.</p>\n  <p><strong>Routing you don't control.</strong> OpenAI's cached states live on individual machines. Above roughly 15 requests per minute, overflow routing can send your request to a machine with no matching entry. There's a <code>prompt_cache_key</code> parameter to improve that. Your hit rate is partly an infrastructure property, not purely a property of your prompt.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"ranking-it-against-the-other-levers\" href=\"#ranking-it-against-the-other-levers\"> </a> Ranking it against the other levers</h2>\n  <p>I measured three cost levers on the same workload:</p>\n  <div class=\"table-wrapper-paragraph\">\n   <table>\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Lever</th>\n      <th>Impact</th>\n      <th>Quality cost</th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Switch to a cheaper model</td>\n      <td>up to 26x</td>\n      <td>changes answers</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td><strong>Cache a stable prefix</strong></td>\n      <td><strong>39 to 90%</strong></td>\n      <td><strong>none</strong></td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Trim retrieved context 60%</td>\n      <td>~10%</td>\n      <td>changes answers</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </div>\n  <p>Caching is the only one on that list that costs you nothing in quality. Trimming context can change answers. Switching models definitely changes answers. Caching is the same tokens at a lower price.</p>\n  <p>Yet it's the one absent from every \"reduce your LLM costs\" article I've read, all of which are about prompt engineering, the lever measured at about 10%.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"check-your-own-stack\" href=\"#check-your-own-stack\"> </a> Check your own stack</h2>\n  <p>Here's the whole verification, about a cent to run:\n   <br></p>\n  <div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n   <pre class=\"highlight python\"><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">requests</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">KEY</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">environ</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">OPENROUTER_API_KEY</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">UNIT</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">The customer success team reviews consumption trends weekly to </span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">identify accounts where adoption has plateaued or declined. </span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">PREFIX</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">UNIT</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">45</span>   <span class=\"c1\"># ~2,600 tokens, comfortably over the 1,024 minimum\n</span>\n<span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"nf\">go</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">question</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">use_cache_control</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">False</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">system</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">type</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">text</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">text</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">PREFIX</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">cache_control</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">type</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">ephemeral</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">}}]</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">use_cache_control</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"n\">PREFIX</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">body</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">model</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">~anthropic/claude-sonnet-latest</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">max_tokens</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">usage</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">include</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"bp\">True</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">messages</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">system</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">system</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">role</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">user</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">content</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">question</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">],</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">u</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">Authorization</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">Bearer </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">KEY</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">120</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nf\">json</span><span class=\"p\">().</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">usage</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{})</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">d</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">prompt_tokens_details</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"nf\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s\">: input=</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"s\">prompt_tokens</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s\"> </span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span>\n          <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">cached=</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"s\">cached_tokens</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s\"> </span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span>\n          <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">written=</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"s\">cache_write_tokens</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s\"> </span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span>\n          <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">cost=$</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"s\">cost</span><span class=\"sh\">'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">:</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">go</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">cold</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">Summarize in one sentence.</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">use_cache_control</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">sleep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nf\">go</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">warm</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"s\">Summarize in five words.</span><span class=\"sh\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">use_cache_control</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre>\n   <div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n    <div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\">\n      <title>Enter fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n     <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\">\n      <title>Exit fullscreen mode</title> <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n     </svg>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Flip <code>use_cache_control</code> to <code>False</code> and run it again. The gap between those two runs is what you've been leaving on the table.</p>\n  <p>The key thing to check is whether <code>cached_tokens</code> comes back non-zero. Whether you <em>should</em> be getting cache hits and whether you <em>are</em> getting them are different questions, and only one of them is answerable from a pricing page.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"caveats\" href=\"#caveats\"> </a> Caveats</h2>\n  <ul>\n   <li>These are measurements from <strong>August 25, 2026</strong>. Pricing in this space moves weekly.</li>\n   <li>The catalog-wide numbers are published prices, not measured traffic. Only the cold/warm tests are direct measurements.</li>\n   <li>I tested through a single gateway. Direct API behavior may differ.</li>\n   <li>I didn't measure Bedrock or Vertex, both of which have their own caching implementations. That's my next test.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>All the scripts are here if you want the full set:\n   <br>\n   <a href=\"https://github.com/ptokito/llm-cost-lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com/ptokito/llm-cost-lab</a></p>\n  <p>If you run this and see something different from what I measured, I'd like to hear about it.</p>\n  <h2><a name=\"the-oneline-version\" href=\"#the-oneline-version\"> </a> The one-line version</h2>\n  <p>Every LLM cost comparison uses two prices. There is a third: cached input, typically 10x cheaper. For RAG and agent workloads that is where most of the money is.</p>\n  <p>But only if your prompt clears the minimum, your prefix is byte-identical, you're inside the TTL, and your provider doesn't require you to ask.</p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "这篇文章揭示了 LLM 使用中一个重要的成本优化机会：通过利用提示缓存，在正确配置的情况下，输入成本最多可降低 90%，该结论基于对 393 个模型的实验。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "这篇文章揭示了 LLM 使用中一个重要的成本优化机会：通过利用提示缓存，在正确配置的情况下，输入成本最多可降低 90%，该结论基于对 393 个模型的实验。",
  "summary": "这项技术分析展示了提示缓存在多个 LLM 提供商中的工作原理。作者进行的实验表明，缓存的输入 token 成本比全新输入低约 90%，但需要满足特定条件：相同的前缀、最低 token 阈值以及正确的缓存配置。主要发现包括 Anthropic 的手动缓存控制、OpenAI 的自动缓存，以及稳定前缀设计的关键重要性。研究还强调了常见的陷阱，如时间戳前缀、短缓存 TTL 和路由问题。文中提供了一个实用的代码示例来验证缓存利用率。",
  "mainPoints": [
